  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Dominate the sun and great outdoors with our Camo Boonie Hat! These military sun hats are made to government specifications, and provide 360-degree defense from the sun. With a wide, structured brim, these military boonies shade your neck and face, keeping you cool. These military hats are great for playing a few rounds of airsoft, along with hunting, hiking, fishing, and other outdoor activities!</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "38671",
  "description": "<p>Dominate the sun and great outdoors with our Camo Boonie Hat! These military sun hats are made to government specifications, and provide 360-degree defense from the sun. With a wide, structured brim, these military boonies shade your neck and face, keeping you cool. These military hats are great for playing a few rounds of airsoft, along with hunting, hiking, fishing, and other outdoor activities!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Tough and Long-Lasting Materials:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Go ahead and wear your camouflage boonie hat without a worry! Constructed from a durable 55% cotton / 45% polyester blend, these camo hats easily withstand consistent outdoor use and sun exposure while providing a comfortable fit and feel.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Tri-Color Desert &amp; MultiCam Patterns:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tri-Color Desert Camo Boonie is 55% cotton / 45% polyester rip-stop, while MultiCam Boonie is 65% polyester / 35% cotton rip-stop. The MultiCam fabric is U.S. made, and is licensed through Crye Industries.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Tactical Utility</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Each military camouflage hat features branch loops that are woven into and around the crown, allowing you to camouflage with surrounding vegetation, such as small branches, leaves, and plants.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Designed with Comfort in Mind:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These military hats also feature 4 screened side vents that cool you down by circulating hot or humid air away from your head. The adjustable chin strap ensures the camouflage bucket hat stays in place during a windy day or when you&rsquo;re in motion.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>All Things Camo:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rothco stands out as the leader in camouflage clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over six decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective camouflage gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of camouflage, with over 35 patterns available! From outdoor enthusiasts and active-duty personnel, to skate and fashion, Rothco is the go-to brand for camo.</li>\n</ul>",
